d egocentric attitude on real\u2011time crew coordination, and whether they could be mitigated through training.\n**What would change my vote:** If new information showed that Candidate\u202fD possesses strong, demonstrable leadership and teamwork skills that offset his arrogance, or that Candidate\u202fC\u2019s communication issues are severe enough to jeopardize safety, I would reconsider and possibly shift to D or another candidate.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
