ndidates have serious interpersonal drawbacks: D\u2019s arrogance/weak leadership versus C\u2019s communication difficulties and egocentricity.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\n- How much D\u2019s arrogance and weak leadership would actually impair crew coordination and authority on long flights.\n- How severe C\u2019s communication problems are in real\u2011time cockpit interaction and whether his egocentric stance would erode crew cohesion over extended missions.\n**What would change my vote:**\n- Concrete evidence that D demonstrates strong, effective leadership and teamwork that offset his arrogance (e.g., documented crew\u2011feedback praising his authority and cooperation).\n- Conversely, credible evidence that C\u2019s communication deficits lead to critical misunderstandings or safety\u2011relevant errors in the cockpit.\nGiven the current balance, I remain inclined toward Candidate\u202fD but with moderate confidence, pending clarification of the above uncertainties.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate D\"}"}
